        "text_mLc66y": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Pressure-sensitive adhesive tapes and safety labels are used in a variety of nuclear applications to warn users of potential radioactive hazards and guarantee the safety of individuals in the vicinity. Adhesive tapes seal ducts, pipes, connections, and caps to prevent leakage of radioactive materials into and out of nuclear power generation equipment.</p><p>Critical warning tape, safety decals, and hazard labels are also applied to surfaces in medical diagnostic equipment, industrial labs, and academic research facilities. Nuclear decals and radioactive labels identify radioactive materials and provide handling instructions throughout manufacturing, storage, and shipping processes. With quality nuclear labels and RAD warning signage, facilities reduce the potential for dangerous radiation exposure.</p>",
