        "collapsible_item_wB8M6A": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "What are the various types of nuclear tapes and labels?",
            "content": "<p>Accurate labeling, visible signage, and clear delineation of hazardous areas are crucial for safe nuclear operations. Pressure-sensitive adhesive tapes and labels are the perfect way to ensure that workers are both informed and protected. Common nuclear labels and tapes include:</p><ul><li><strong>Warning Labels and Signage:</strong> Labels and signage are used to indicate the level of risk for radiation exposure and advise of appropriate precautions.</li><li><strong>Sealing and Marking Tapes:</strong> Tapes are used to seal containers and equipment to prevent radioactive leakage. They can also be created with custom surface finishes and printed markings to provide critical warnings and protection information.</li><li><strong>RAD Wipe Test Smears: </strong>RAD wipe test smears are specialized cloth disks that allow users to test for radiation contamination through a simple test swipe.</li></ul>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": true,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_HrcRVU": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Benefits of Nuclear Tapes and Labels",
            "content": "<p>Tapes and labels used for nuclear applications are specifically designed for reliability in critical applications. To ensure that they meet stringent industry specifications and regulatory requirements, NADCO’s nuclear tapes and labels come with the following features:</p><ul><li>Superior conformability</li><li>Flame retardancy</li><li>Free of low melting-point metals such as mercury and cadmium</li><li>Minimal halogen and sulfide content</li><li>Outstanding adhesion</li><li>High-tack adhesive</li><li>Waterproof backing</li><li>Ideal for both indoor and outdoor applications</li><li>Reduces stress cracking in stainless steel pipes</li></ul>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_jxa4Ep": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Durable Nuclear Tape and Labels From NADCO",
            "content": "<p>At NADCO, we are dedicated to providing our customers in the nuclear industry with dependable adhesive solutions that meet and exceed even the most stringent standards. We produce and supply a variety of pressure-sensitive products ideal for warning, marking, sealing, repairing, and smear testing for various industries that use radioactive materials. Our products are held to the highest standards as dictated by the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC).</p><p>To learn more about our extensive selection of nuclear tape and label solutions,<a href=\"https://info.nadco-inc.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\"> contact us today</a> or request a quote below.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
