          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits of Nuclear Tapes and Labels",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_i3qdf3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Tapes and labels used for nuclear applications are specifically designed for reliability in critical applications. To ensure that they meet stringent industry specifications and regulatory requirements, NADCO’s nuclear tapes and labels come with the following features:</p><ul><li>Superior conformability</li><li>Flame retardancy</li><li>Free of low melting-point metals such as mercury and cadmium</li><li>Minimal halogen and sulfide content</li><li>Outstanding adhesion</li><li>High-tack adhesive</li><li>Waterproof backing</li><li>Ideal for both indoor and outdoor applications</li><li>Reduces stress cracking in stainless steel pipes</li></ul>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_tVP79Q",
        "text_i3qdf3"
      ],
