    "rich_text_FwNGmH": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_qwUDfp": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Durable Nuclear Tape and Labels From NADCO",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_KGtytN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At NADCO, we are dedicated to providing our customers in the nuclear industry with dependable adhesive solutions that meet and exceed even the most stringent standards. We produce and supply a variety of pressure-sensitive products ideal for warning, marking, sealing, repairing, and smear testing for various industries that use radioactive materials. Our products are held to the highest standards as dictated by the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC).</p><p>To learn more about our extensive selection of nuclear tape and label solutions,<a href=\"https://info.nadco-inc.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\"> contact us today</a> or<a href=\"https://www.nadco-inc.com/request-quote/\"> request a quote</a>.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
